{"id":1051001,"name":"밀리·심문 I","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"밀리·심문 I","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1051001]}],"trial":{"trial_id":51001,"stage":"1단계","unlock_time":"2025-09-23 14:00:00","diary1":"극락의 경계호 사건 이후, 밀리는 건강상 문제로 국장과 함께 MBCC로 돌아올 수 없었다. 그녀는 크게 실망했고, 심지어 과격한 수단을 사용하려 했다.","diary2":"당신을 향한 밀리의 사랑은 진실되고 열정적이었다. 당신은 두 사람이 건강하고 정상적인 상황에서 만나길 바랐지만, 지금은 잠시 떨어져 다시 만날 수 있는 날을 차분히 기다려야 했다. 다시 만나게 되는 날, 두 사람이 모두 충분히 준비되어 있길 바란다.","evidence":[{"ID":260771,"Num":1},{"ID":260773,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260772,"Num":1},{"ID":260774,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151001023,